{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18321","headline":"九月九日勤政楼下观百僚献寿 · 王涯","name":"九月九日勤政楼下观百僚献寿","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"御气黄花节，临轩紫陌头。\n早阳生彩仗，霁色入仙楼。\n献寿皆鵷鹭，瞻天尽冕旒。\n菊樽过九日，凤历肇千秋。\n乐奏薰风起，盃酣瑞影收。\n年年歌舞度，此地庆皇休。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"王涯","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18321.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18321","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}